		{"id":"p-automate","text":"Automate「Phone Usage Logger」\n• 采集: 前台包名 / 亮灭屏 / 心跳（最小事实）\n• 位置: 手机常驻 Flow（开机启动）\n• 每 15 分钟 PUT 上传，X-Upload-Token 鉴权\n• 故障: 心跳缺失 >30min → 手机端自检（10.3）","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":360,"height":111,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p-bridge","text":"Focus Bridge 1.3.3(18)\n• 介入桥接: 15s 轮询 pending + 5min 心跳\n• 10s 原生选择页（接受/拒绝/忽略）\n• 执行「不做手机控」并回传 final\n• 请求级幂等账本 + 24h 完成墓碑","type":"text","x":0,"y":137,"width":360,"height":111,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p-getaway","text":"「不做手机控」APP\n• 快速番茄/专注的实际执行端\n• 由桥接打开，不负责心跳/唤醒","type":"text","x":0,"y":274,"width":360,"height":81,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p-ntfy","text":"ntfy APP（手机）\n• 订阅 ntfy.sh 私有主题\n• 仅展示通知（深夜/15:00/维护等）","type":"text","x":0,"y":381,"width":360,"height":81,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p-feedback","text":"人工反馈入口（手机/浏览器）\n• POST /annotation 半小时报告纠错（Bearer）\n• Next Action 反馈: responses / outcomes\n• 网页问题: issue-feedback","type":"text","x":0,"y":488,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"t-tablet","text":"平板 MatePad（⚠️ 待确认）\n• 当前交接材料确认 USB 投屏用于线上授课\n• 同时存在 tablet_* 上传接口与 tablet_facts\n• 近期规则称平板不作为提醒触发设备\n• 是否仍在采集/上传：待核实","type":"text","x":384,"y":0,"width":360,"height":111,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 总体流程 · 手机 / 平板 / 电脑 / 树莓派\n面向维护的总览：模块职责 + 数据流 + 端口。核心节点 27 个，跨设备跳转对应单端 Canvas。","x":0,"y":-210,"width":620,"height":66,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c-aw","text":"ActivityWatch 采集 + 同步\n• aw-watcher-window/afk → aw-server :5600\n• 计划任务每 5 分钟 push → Syncthing 镜像 Pi\n• 分类规则 categories-v5.json（层级深度优先）","type":"text","x":768,"y":0,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-obsidian","text":"Obsidian + Pi Context Sync 插件\n• 任务/Profile/番茄钟 Markdown = 唯一事实源\n• Context Exporter 每 20 分钟导出上下文\n• 插件是唯一 Markdown 写入者（单向）","type":"text","x":768,"y":122,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-pomodoro","text":"New Pomodoro Timer 插件\n• 5s 同步 Pi /api/bootstrap（Pi 会话权威）\n• Work 默认 40 分钟（1🍅=40min）\n• start/pause/resume → :8460","type":"text","x":768,"y":244,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-agent","text":"介入 Agent + Cold Turkey\n• 5s 轮询 pending → 弹窗 → lease 封锁 → final\n• allowlist: 常刷网站 / bilibili\n• 5min heartbeat；按绝对到期时间回收\n• ⚠️ 启动形态：最新交接称登录后计划任务，旧文档冲突","type":"text","x":768,"y":366,"width":360,"height":111,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-funnel","text":"公网 HTTPS :443（文档称 Funnel；\n具体桥接代理机制仍待确认）\n• /upload/*.jsonl + /annotation\n• Focus Bridge /focus-bridge/* 固定白名单\n• 其余服务一律不暴露公网","type":"text","x":1152,"y":0,"width":360,"height":111,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-serve","text":"Tailscale Serve（tailnet-only）\n• :8450 → advisor-web :8767（Next Action）\n• :8460 → focus-garden :8838（花园）\n• :8443 → Monaco Lite :8766（规则编辑）","type":"text","x":1152,"y":137,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"pi-recv","text":"phone-usage-receiver :8765\n• :443 入口；token 校验 + 去重归档\n• incoming/ + archive/YYYY-MM-DD\n• 维护 timer 03:30（30 天压缩/365 天删除）","type":"text","x":1536,"y":0,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"🎨 图例\n🟢 绿=自动流程/服务  🟡 黄=数据/配置/状态\n🔵 青=网络边界/接口  🟣 紫=文档（点击打开）\n🔴 红=人工操作/故障入口  🟠 橙=⚠️待确认\n→ 边=数据流/触发关系\n维护：改模块前先看它的入边（依赖）与出边（影响范围）","x":660,"y":-340,"width":430,"height":126,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"pi-syncthing","text":"syncthing@conrad.service\n• 接收: activitywatch-sync / behavior-context-sync\n• 发送: focus-garden-archive 快照（send-only）\n• 单向同步，禁止双向写 SQLite","type":"text","x":1536,"y":122,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"pi-halfhour","text":"半小时处理链（:08/:38 触发）\n• facts → 合并 → 标签 → 语义时间线 → 指标\n• → AI 报告 ai_reports/ → 影子干预候选\n• would_intervene=true → ntfy 半小时提醒","type":"text","x":1536,"y":244,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e-deepseek","text":"DeepSeek API\n• V4 flash: 语义时间线/近期动态解析/15:00 裁决\n• V4 Pro: 日报建议 / Next Action 决策\n• 失败降级本地规则或低置信报告","type":"text","x":1920,"y":0,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e-ntfy","text":"ntfy.sh（通知）\n• 深夜 / 15:00 / 系统维护 / 半小时候选 / 日报\n• 主题仅存 Pi 私有 env（600 权限）","type":"text","x":1920,"y":122,"width":360,"height":81,"color":"5"},
