		{"id":"pi-life","text":"生活统计与提醒 timers\n• 日报 09/10/11 · 周报 周一 09:05\n• 深夜 00:30–04:30 · 15:00 任务检查\n• 系统维护守护 每 3 分钟","type":"text","x":1536,"y":366,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"pi-web","text":"Next Action Web :8767 → :8450\n• 建议生成（V4 Pro thinking）+ 2 轮澄清\n• 任务 mutation queue / 近期动态\n• 介入 API / issue-feedback / heartbeat","type":"text","x":1536,"y":488,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"pi-garden","text":"专注花园 focus-garden :8838 → :8460\n• Pi 权威 SQLite（唯一写入端）\n• NextAction 代理（loopback :8767 白名单）\n• 备份 timer 每分钟 → 快照镜像","type":"text","x":1536,"y":610,"width":360,"height":96,"color":"4"},
